                        "username": "bradbishop"
                    },
                    "message": "Deleting copy is fine but generally I think defaulting move is best when its available so that class users can be in control of the ownership semantics of their APIs without hacks/wrappers.\n```suggestion\n    PldmEntityReq(PldmEntityReq&&) = default;\n    PldmEntityReq& operator=(PldmEntityReq&&) = default;\n```"
